---
import Mark from './Mark.astro';
---

<section class="section" id="model">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="headline">How the model works</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        The drafting agent holds full repository context while reviewing subagents start with a blank slate, exposing blind spots before they become code.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pair">
      <article class="role">
        <Mark variant="elephant" class="glyph" />
        <h3 class="title">Elephant</h3>
        <p class="role-sub">Full context</p>
        <p class="muted">
          Deep-context agents loaded with system history, architecture, component boundaries, and
          user journeys. The Elephant runs structured brainstorming, probes operational limits, and
          drafts the specification.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="role">
        <Mark variant="goldfish" class="glyph" />
        <h3 class="title">Goldfish</h3>
        <p class="role-sub">Zero context</p>
        <p class="muted">
          Stateless, isolated subagents that read only the draft spec and the live source, with none
          of the conversation&rsquo;s bias. A swarm of goldfish stress-tests the design from
          conflicting perspectives before any code exists.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <div class="human">
      <div>
        <h3 class="title">You</h3>
        <p class="role-sub">Final decision</p>
      </div>
      <p class="muted">
        Agents explore options and audit drafts, while engineers make the architectural trade-offs and approve every specification before implementation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pair,
  .human {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 32px clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
  }

  .pair {
    padding-block-end: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);
  }

  .human {
    padding-block-start: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .pair,
    .human {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .role {
    max-inline-size: 48ch;
  }

  .pair :global(.glyph) {
    inline-size: 56px;
    block-size: 56px;
    margin-block-end: 20px;
  }

  .role-sub {
    font: var(--md-sys-typescale-title-lg);
    letter-spacing: var(--md-sys-typescale-title-lg-tracking);
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
    margin-block: 2px 14px;
  }

  .human .muted {
    font: var(--md-sys-typescale-body-lg);
    max-inline-size: 56ch;
  }
</style>
